---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  canonical="about.html"
  title="About Keith | Suites With Keith"
  description="Who plans your trip, what it costs, and how it works. Hotel bookings are complimentary; the judgment comes with them."
  current="about"
>

<!-- masthead -->
<section class="section" style="padding-bottom:0;">
  <div class="container about-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">About</p>
      <h1 class="display-xl reveal" style="margin-top:18px;">Meet Keith</h1>
      <p class="deck reveal" style="margin-top:22px; max-width:38ch;">Last year I spent four weeks checking into 38 hotels across eight Greek islands &mdash; because &ldquo;which room should we book?&rdquo; deserves a better answer than a screenshot of someone else&rsquo;s stay.</p>
      <p class="body-2 reveal" style="margin-top:22px; max-width:52ch;">I&rsquo;m a Fora travel advisor specializing in Europe, honeymoons and hotels worth the airfare. I tour the properties, sleep in the rooms where it matters, keep the notes &mdash; and when you book through me, the hotel hears from me before you arrive.</p>
      <p class="stamp reveal" style="margin-top:28px;">Fora advisor &middot; 123 hotels on file &middot; 38 toured &amp; stayed, Cyclades 2025</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="reveal" style="margin:0;">
      <img src="/images/personal/keith-acropolis.jpg" alt="Keith at the Acropolis, Athens" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="aspect-ratio:4/5; object-fit:cover;" />
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- how it works -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Three steps, no homework</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger reveal" style="border-top-color:var(--hairline);">
      <div class="ledger-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--hairline);"><span class="n" style="color:var(--brass);">01</span><span class="d" style="color:var(--ash);"><b style="color:var(--ink);">Tell me where and when.</b> One sentence is enough &mdash; &ldquo;Santorini in June.&rdquo; Traveling inside 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me the same day.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--hairline);"><span class="n" style="color:var(--brass);">02</span><span class="d" style="color:var(--ash);"><b style="color:var(--ink);">Get a recommendation with reasons.</b> Three or four hotels, the room worth booking at each, and what each one is wrong for. Not a list &mdash; a verdict.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--hairline);"><span class="n" style="color:var(--brass);">03</span><span class="d" style="color:var(--ash);"><b style="color:var(--ink);">I book it and stay on it.</b> Same rate as booking direct &mdash; sometimes better &mdash; plus the perks, and my call to the hotel before you land.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- pricing -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">What it costs</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Plain numbers</h2>
    </div>
    <dl class="kv reveal">
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Hotel bookings</dt><dd><b>Complimentary.</b> Recommendations, booking and preferred-partner perks included.</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Transfers &amp; logistics</dt><dd><b>From $350.</b> Private airport transfers, rail and ferry coordination &mdash; including private boats between islands and helicopters through Hoper.</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Full-trip planning</dt><dd><b>From $500.</b> The whole itinerary: hotels, rooms worth the upgrade, tables worth booking, the ferry that beats the flight &mdash; and what isn&rsquo;t worth your money.</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Yachts &amp; jets</dt><dd>Through trusted charter brokers &mdash; day boats to crewed weeks, one-way hops to round trips.</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Corporate &amp; groups</dt><dd>Custom &mdash; one point of contact from first inquiry to wheels down.</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row"><dt>Annual retainer</dt><dd><b>By invitation.</b> One flat fee, unlimited planning, all year. Offered to a small number of clients.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- the questions that matter -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The question everyone asks</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">&ldquo;Why not just use my Amex?&rdquo;</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="story-quote reveal" style="max-width:none;">The perks are similar. <b>The experience isn&rsquo;t.</b></p>
    <p class="body-2 reveal" style="margin-top:26px; max-width:56ch;">Amex and Chase can match the breakfast and the credit. What they can&rsquo;t do is tell you which of two hotels is right for <em>you</em>, name the room worth the difference, or call the property before you arrive. Have FHR credits? Use both: book one night through Amex, the rest through me, and you usually keep the benefits of each.</p>
    <dl class="kv reveal" style="margin-top:44px; border-top-color:var(--band-hairline);">
      <div class="kv-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--band-hairline);"><dt style="color:var(--band-ash);">Already booked?</dt><dd style="color:var(--band-ash);">In many cases I can take over the reservation as your advisor and add the partner benefits to a stay you already have.</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--band-hairline);"><dt style="color:var(--band-ash);">Points?</dt><dd style="color:var(--band-ash);">I consult on Amex, Chase, Citi and Bilt points &mdash; including business and first-class award flights.</dd></div>
      <div class="kv-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--band-hairline);"><dt style="color:var(--band-ash);">How far ahead?</dt><dd style="color:var(--band-ash);">Three to six months is ideal. Shorter works &mdash; a Saint-Tropez peak-season save once took 24 hours.</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ask -->
<section class="section inquire" id="inquire">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Where and when?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:38ch;">That&rsquo;s the whole form. I&rsquo;ll take it from there.</p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Inquiry — About page" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="about" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when">Where and when?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="Amalfi in May" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name">And where do I send the recommendation?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Send</button>
      <p class="note">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .about-grid { display: grid; gap: 44px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; align-items: end; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr; } }
</style>
